MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Ok, use the function pdf() then, for instance :

data(tico)
d <- duration(tico)
time <- seq(0, d, by=d/4)

pdf("spectro.pdf")
for(i in 1:(length(time)-1))
    {
       spectro(tico, tlim=c(time[i], time[i+1]))
        }
dev.off()

But be carefull the final pdf might be bery heavy.

Best

Jerome

